{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約書亞記","commonName":"約書亞記","title":"約書亞記","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"f7e1b1e3a4dc3046bef5e950d8950a0c7949bc630099873ff7e5975154253ce8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":656},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["分給以法蓮支派和瑪拿西半支派的土地"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["約瑟的子孫拈鬮所得之地是從靠近耶利哥的約旦河起，以耶利哥東邊的水為界：從耶利哥上去，通過山地的曠野，到伯特利；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["又從伯特利到路斯，接連到亞基人的境界，至亞他綠；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又往西下到押利提人的境界，到下伯‧和崙的境界，直到基色，通到海為止。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["約瑟的兒子瑪拿西、以法蓮就得了他們的地業。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["以法蓮支派"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["以法蓮子孫的境界，按着宗族所得的，記在下面：他們地業的東界是亞他綠‧亞達到上伯‧和崙；"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["往西通到北邊的密米他，又向東繞到他納‧示羅，又接連到雅挪哈的東邊；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["從雅挪哈下到亞他綠，又到拿拉，達到耶利哥，通到約旦河為止；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["從他普亞往西，到加拿河，直通到海為止。這就是以法蓮支派按着宗族所得的地業。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["另外在瑪拿西人地業中得了些城邑和屬城的村莊。這都是分給以法蓮子孫的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們沒有趕出住基色的迦南人；迦南人卻住在以法蓮人中間，成為做苦工的僕人，直到今日。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JOS/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}